/* Original dialogue written for the stable-base rebuild. */
static const char*const ascent_finale_dialogue[ASCENT_FINALE_PAGES]={
 "Three paths reach the same dawn. The Warden, Vesper and the Proxy remember every life the rift kept apart.",
 "VESPER: Three anchors. He could bind us again while even one remained. WARDEN: Then this was never a climb we could finish alone.",
 "PROXY: His seal fed the dark with our returning lives. I have struck our names from its record. The lights turn inward; the tower closes behind them.",
 "WARDEN: No oath brings us back. VESPER: No stolen name. PROXY: No borrowed testimony. For the first time, the silence holds.",
 "Below, the city opens its gates. Three shadows cross the threshold together. The rift keeps its echoes. What happens next belongs to the living."
};
static const char*const ascent_dialogue[3][4][3]={
{{"The Hollow King falls. Far below, the furnace gates open and the bells sound for the living.","I lay my broken oath beside his empty crown. The road below belongs to those who survived it.","For once, I descend without an order. My watch is over. Let the dead rest."},{"That was no throne. It was a lock.","Something below the light is still pulling my chains.","Then I keep climbing. Until there is nothing left to kneel to."},{"UNMAKER: I wrote your suffering into the stone.","WARDEN: Then watch me tear out the fucking page.","UNMAKER: You cannot kill the hand that made you."},{"You forged me to bear your chains.","You should have made them stronger.","No more masters. No more graves. We walk out of here alive."}},
{{"The Hollow King falls, and the choir loses its final command. The city below wakes to its own voices.","I leave the white cloak on the throne. No witness will be silenced in its name again.","At the open gate, someone asks my name. Vesper, I tell them. This time, I keep it."},{"The choir is dead. So who is still singing?","There. A voice behind the wound in the world.","One last throat. One last prayer."},{"UNMAKER: Every blade you carried was part of my design.","VESPER: Then you know exactly how this ends.","UNMAKER: I gave you your name. VESPER: You can choke on it."},{"You taught the world to fear the dark.","Now it knows what the dark was hiding from.","My name is Vesper. And no one owns it anymore."}},
{{"The Hollow King falls. The lights held in his seal scatter into the city, carrying the names he erased.","I leave my office vacant. Those beneath it have endured enough witnesses speaking in their place.","One voice remains in the glass to guide the descent. For once, I can answer it in my own words."},{"The restored names are vanishing from the record.","Someone beyond this room is writing over them.","This time the witness will meet the author."},{"UNMAKER: I decide which lives the record can retain.","PROXY: Then it is time to open the binding.","UNMAKER: Without me, you are nothing. PROXY: Watch nothing rise."},{"Your ledger was a prison made of omissions.","I owe the missing more than another signature.","These lives are no longer yours to revise. Let each speak for itself."}},
};
